//   - Sprites.get(id) -> svg string or null
//   - Sprites.plantSprite(pid, depth) -> svg for chain depth
//   - Sprites.chainFor(pid) -> [root, category, specific]
//   - Sprites.monsterSprite(mid, aggro) -> calm or aggro svg for monster
// rules:
//   - (none documented)
// consumes:
//   - (none documented)
